YEL连翘：这位少侠留步，我观你面相红润，今日必是走大运之相！我有个不错的想法，少侠要不要听听？NOR]]}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",1}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0514","any"}}}},autoResult2={{type="stop",args={}},{type="doc",args={"YEL连翘：少侠别急呀，再考虑一下嘛。NOR"}}},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",8}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0544","hdroom0514"}}}},autoResult3={{type="stop",args={}},{type="doc",args={"YEL连翘：先别乱逛啦。NOR"}}},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",10}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0544","hdroom0514"}}}},autoResult4={{type="stop",args={}},{type="doc",args={"YEL连翘：先别乱逛啦。NOR"}}},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0515={id="hdroom0515",name="平安大街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="新春清晨，朝露还未晞，朝阳还未完全升起，平安大街的人们各个都很有活力。街旁的车马行的生意变得异常火热，无论是本地镇民还是外地来客，纷纷在车马行停车下马卸货，随后又马不停蹄地赶往另外的街区，导致平安大街上一片拥挤。",down="hdroom0548",left="hdroom0544",right="hdroom0516",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0516={id="hdroom0516",name="平安西街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="正是今年风景美，千红万紫报春光。新春佳节，平安西街两旁的各色店铺大门敞开，首饰店和铁匠铺趁着新春推出了新的货品，一时之间，貌美如花的姑娘们，英武不凡的侠客们，分别将首饰店和铁匠铺围得水泄不通，让店家掌柜招呼不及。",up="hdroom0511",left="hdroom0515",right="hdroom0517",roomRoles={"bsnpc13"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation=