几个妇人或手提竹篮，或牵着幼童，均站在大街的一角说笑。",up="hdroom0518",down="hdroom0527",roomRoles={"bsnpc27"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",3}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0518","hdroom0524"}}}},autoResult1={{type="stop",args={}},{type="doc",args={"YEL连翘：先别乱逛啦。NOR"}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",10}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0518","hdroom0524"}}}},autoResult2={{type="stop",args={}},{type="doc",args={"YEL连翘：先别乱逛啦。NOR"}}},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0525={id="hdroom0525",name="庙会戏台",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="趁着新春，戏团最近新上了几幕新戏，引得不少孩童和江湖人士围聚。周边贩卖糕点瓜果的小贩自然不会错过这个机会，早早就备好一切，等着看戏之人到来。前来看戏的观众把戏台围得里三层外三层，有人提着春节花灯，有人戴着春节面具，熙熙攘攘，热闹非凡。",up="hdroom0519",roomRoles={"bsnpc11"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0526={id="hdroom0526",name="比武台",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="生盆火烈轰鸣竹，守岁筳开听颂椒。朝阳初升，新春的第一场比斗，比武台下早已人山人海，锣鼓喧天，而台上的江湖好汉正在卖力表演，看到精彩处，有钱的看客往台上丢个红包讨个彩头，没钱的看客也会大声喝彩，拍烂手掌。",up="hdroom0520",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0527={id="hdroom0527",name="平安南街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="稚童新衣相夸耀，旧去新来气象清。平安南街北通中央广场，小贩们多在此处摆摊，卖些干果、肉脯，悬挂在摊口的几尾咸鱼身上还贴上了红纸福字。几个妇人或手提竹篮，或牵着幼童，均站在大街的一角说笑。",up="hdroom0524",down="hdroom0528",right="hdroom0546",roomRoles={"bsnpc22"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0528={id="hdroom0528",name="平安南街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="稚童新衣相夸耀，旧去新来气象清。平安南街北通中央广场，小贩们多在此处摆摊，卖些干果、肉脯，悬挂在摊口的几尾咸鱼身上还贴上了红纸福字。几个妇人或手提竹篮，或牵着幼童，均站在大街的一角说笑。",up="hdroom0527",down="hdroom0529",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0529={id="hdroom0529",name="流樱湖",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="流樱湖上喧嚣不断，清澈的湖水上货船画舫争奇斗艳。货船随波逐流，上面挂着各式各样的大红灯笼，吸引岸边之人的眼球。画舫更是使尽各种招数：乐师吹拉弹唱，美人齐舞翩翩，引得岸上的观众大呼小叫，恨不得把自己的钱囊投入水中。",up="hdroom0528",left="hdroom0551",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",9}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0551","hdroom0529"}}}},autoResult1={{type="gaintab",args={"311001",10}},{type="addobject",args={"rwnpc07"}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0530={id="hdroom0530",name="菜来饭馆",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="二层高的酒楼。前几日来了几个东洋客商，掌柜的一时高兴买了些罕见的食材，所以门口木牌上写菜名都是你从未听过的。一伙侠客相约至此比酒，吆喝着小二将一坛坛上好的女儿红抱了上来，旁边两个妇人不知道为何吵了起来，整个饭馆内热闹非凡。",left="hdroom0510",right="hdroom0531",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",5}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0510","hdroom0530"}}}},autoResult1={{type="stop",args={}},{type="doc",args={"YEL连翘：先别乱逛啦。NOR"}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",15}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0530","any"}}}},autoResult2={{type="stop",args={}},{type="doc",args={"YEL连翘：先别乱逛啦。NOR"}}},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",14}},{type="inroom",args={"any","hdroom0530"}}}},autoResult3={{type="gaintab",args={"311001",15}},{type="addobject",args={"rwwp17"}}},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0531={id="hdroom0531",name="后厨",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="菜来饭馆的后厨炉火正旺，熊熊的火苗将锅上的食材烧得香气扑鼻，炉火的热气伴随着食物的香气，将新春最后的一丝寒潮驱退殆尽。炉前，数个身穿大褂的厨子忙前忙后，时不时把切好的食材倒入锅里，随后就是一顿锅铲翻飞。",left="hdroom0530",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",11}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0531","any"}}}},autoResult1={{type="stop",args={}},{t