}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0534={id="hdroom0534",name="村外土路",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="一条村子郊外的土路，前面便是平安小镇。几个青年男子正在爬梯擦拭牌坊上的灰尘，地上歪斜着两个大红灯笼。不远处传来马啼嘶鸣，在车夫的吆喝下几辆载人的马车匆匆而过。",up="hdroom0550",left="hdroom0533",right="hdroom0535",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0535={id="hdroom0535",name="平丘山",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="严寒已淡，春意渐浓。平丘山上积雪消融，苍白的草地上开始透出些许嫩绿。山亭外的小树绿荫盎然，新春之际，有人在树上挂上了红布条，每条红布条上分别写了几个字，有“平安顺遂”，也有“平安多福”布条迎风招展，煞是好看。",left="hdroom0534",rightUp="hdroom0554",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0536={id="hdroom0536",name="打谷场",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="瑞雪已歇，新春已至，正是一年丰收的开始。打谷场上热火朝天，老农们翻腾占在场边的草堆，铲除野菜、杂草，用耙子将土层扒翻一遍，最后在地面上浇一点水，牵出了自家的牛和农具，把泥土细细压实碾平，这样才算将整个打谷场彻底清理。",up="hdroom0533",down="hdroom0538",right="hdroom0537",roomRoles={"bsnpc21"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0537={id="hdroom0537",name="灌溉井",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="经历了一个冬季的严寒，平安小镇的灌溉井水面已经结了一层薄薄的冰层，而平时引流用的竹管，也被寒霜堵塞。如今春季来临，灌溉井旁已经站了几个村民，正在卖力地打碎井面的冰层，疏通竹管，好让灌溉井在这个播种的季节能正常运作。",left="hdroom0536",leftDown="hdroom0538",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0538={id="hdroom0538",name="碎石小路",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="这里是平安小镇的碎石路，道路宽敞而笔直。此时正逢新春佳节，眼前净是人山人海，否则定能从街头看尽街尾的风光。道路中央，几个从边塞而来的异族正与镇中百姓说话，或因言语不通，令一旁的孩童啼笑不止。",up="hdroom0536",down="hdroom0540",right="hdroom0539",rightUp="hdroom0537",roomRoles={"bsnpc19"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0539={id="hdroom0539",name="农田",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="冬去春来，杨柳吐绿，温暖的阳光照耀着大地。宽阔的农田积雪已化，还未来得及播种，农田里已然长起了野花野草。春阳照耀花蕊，春风摇动花枝，莺燕翩然起舞，蜂蝶留连花间，全都融入这片花田春景之中，各色交杂，美不胜收。",left="hdroom0538",right="hdroom0545",roomRoles={"bsnpc20"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={re