rgs={"311011",1}},{type="addobject",args={"rwnpc02"}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0545={id="hdroom0545",name="石屋",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="石屋外，热情的农夫提着装满鸡蛋的篮子，向路上熟识的镇民派送鸡蛋，随后双方的新春祝福与贺词不绝于耳，其乐融融。石屋里，鸡羽鸭绒散落一地，突然在某一排的鸡窝内传出破壳之声，粉嫩的小鸡摇摇晃晃从壳中钻出，鸡舍在新的春天迎来了新的生命。",left="hdroom0539",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0546={id="hdroom0546",name="澡堂",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="新春之际，平安小镇的澡堂当真客似云来，无论是小镇的居民，还是异乡的游子，都趁着新春佳节来澡堂让自己好好洗头换面，在新的一年里焕然一新。澡堂内的搓澡师傅似乎比以往更加卖力，搓得那些平日里挨惯了拳打脚踢的江湖侠客连连痛呼，让人忍俊不禁。",left="hdroom0527",roomRoles={"bsnpc29"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0547={id="hdroom0547",name="码头",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="清晨，暖和的东风吹来了一阵喧哗的市声，平安江面的冰封早已解冻，此刻码头上帆樯林立，舳舻相接。大大小小的货船在码头上停靠，外地来的商人雇佣了码头上的搬运工，一起将船上各式各样的年货卸到马车上，而后商人掏出大大的红包，把红包一一分发给码头工人，一时间码头上可谓喜气洋洋。",down="hdroom0501",roomRoles={"bsnpc30"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0548={id="hdroom0548",name="车行",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="每逢春节，平安小镇里总是川流不息，而此时小镇的车马行里，账房先生眉开眼笑，一边把算盘打得噼啪作响，一边指挥着小厮们给客人停车歇马。车行的大门并不宽阔，而客人们骑马拖车在车行外等候多时，争先恐后地抢进车行，导致大门内外进出不得，不得不让车行管事出来疏导交通。",up="hdroom0515",left="hdroom0549",roomRoles={"bsnpc23"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0549={id="hdroom0549",name="马房",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="早在数天之前，车行便将马房翻新了一遍，好让马房可以在春节容纳更多的马匹。而此时，马房内的伙计们正忙得焦头烂额：有人负责将马牵入马棚，有人负责在棚内铺上舒爽的干草，有人负责给马匹喂食草料，似是没有一刻可以停歇。",right="hdroom0548",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0550={id="hdroom0550",name="木屋",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="简陋的木屋格外冷清，屋外挂了两个红灯笼迎新春。屋内似乎有人打扫过一遍，墙角斜放着两把锄头和一柄长剑，靠床的木窗下放着两个大木箱，上面一盏烛灯结蜡，除此之外再无其他。",down="hdroom0534",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0551={id="hdroom0551",name="湖畔",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="湖畔树上都挂着小小的彩灯，湖风袭来时随之摇摆，层层涟漪下锦鲤游窜。岸边的青石道上人来人往，甚是热闹。",right="hdroom0529",roomRoles={},roomItems={"rwwp01"},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="tabgr",args={"311001",5}},{type="tablt",args={"311001",8}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0551","any"}}}},autoResult1={{type="stop",args={}},{type="doc",args={"YEL连翘：先别乱逛啦。NOR"}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0552={id="hdroom0552",name="马宅",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="宅邸的门匾上大大写着“马宅”两个字，大门两侧也贴了一对春联，门檐上两个大红灯笼略有些俗气。前头一个巨大的马厩，既像是寻常人家所居之地，又像是后院马房。新春时节小镇到处车水马龙，时常有人牵着马往这头走，误认成驿站车行。",left="hdroom0506",roomRoles={"bsnpc06","bsnpc07"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0553={id="hdroom0553",name="篱笆小院",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="新春伊始，小镇处处喧嚣，唯有这座静谧的篱笆小院与众不同。一枝红梅透出小院的外墙，往里看去，庭院里群芳争艳，蜂蝶飞舞。花花草草们纷纷在院子里找一个角落，为院子增添些许春色。",right="hdroom0502",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0554={id="hdroom0554",name="温泉",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="平安小镇外的一处温泉，水汽氤氲，温暖无比。泉内设了数个小隔间，隔间门上挂着火红的灯笼。",leftDown="hdroom0535",roomRoles={},roomItems={"rwwp03"},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311001",9}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0554","hdroom0535"}}}},autoResult1={{type="stop",args={}},{type="doc",args={"YEL连翘：先别乱逛啦。NOR"}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311012",1}},{type="inroom",args={"any","hdroom0554"}}}},autoResult2={{type="gaintab",args={"311012",2}},{type="change",args={"rwnpc03","rwnpc05"}},{type="addobject",args={"rwwp05"}}},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"311013",1}},{type="equaltab",args={"311009",1}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0554","any"}}}},autoResult3={{type="stop",args={}},{type="doc",args={"CYN先把竹笋给连翘看看吧。NOR"}}},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0555={id="hdroom0555",name="北巷口",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="北内大街一旁的小巷，里面深邃幽暗堆放着不少杂物，很少有人进去。",down="hdroom0505",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",condit